<title>GREECE: TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, JUNE 10.</title>
<headline>TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, JUNE 10.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Greece's fixing rates</p>
<p>for leading currencies on Tuesday were as follows.</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p> Currency:     June 10     June 09   Dec 31 96    NET</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>- USD =	  272.800     273.670     247.020   10.44 %</p>
<p>- ECU =	  309.930     309.840     306.830    1.01 %</p>
<p>- DEM =	  159.230     159.140     158.970    0.16 %</p>
<p>- FRF =	   47.086	47.132	47.182   -0.20 %</p>
<p>- GBP =	  446.740     447.000     419.180    6.57 %</p>
<p>- NLG =	  141.510     141.455     141.685   -0.12 %</p>
<p>- ITL (100) =   16.099	16.135	16.185   -0.53 %</p>
<p>- JPY (100) =  242.500     243.190     212.430   14.16 %</p>
<p>- ESP =	    1.881	 1.881	 1.888   -0.37 %</p>
<p>- PTE =	    1.571	 1.570	 1.581   -0.63 %</p>
<p>- CHF =	  189.000     189.820     183.135    3.20 %</p>
<p>Note: The percentage net change is calculated as the percentage</p>
<p>difference between the most recent fixing rate and the December</p>
<p>31, 1996 rate.</p>
<p>--Angelos Kiosklis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
